export anchor Overview:
    description:
        Brightwork is a generic project tracker for small teams. It exists as a
        lookbook example. Its spec is just deep enough to give the style library
        one realistic screen to draw.

    audience:
        Small teams of five to twenty people who run a handful of projects at
        once. They check the app at the start of the day on a laptop, and now
        and then on a phone.

    job:
        Show at a glance which projects are on track, what is due, and what the
        team did recently.

    languages:
        English only.

    suite:
        For the lookbook, Brightwork is also a small suite. Canvas is a design
        tool, Drive stores files, Code hosts repositories and pull requests,
        and Ops monitors services. Runs 66 to 85 add ten more made-up apps,
        Sound, Sales, Chat, Cut, Money, Home, Move, Mail, Data and Trips. These
        apps exist only to give the dark style runs more kinds of screens to
        draw.
